8", "author": "Brown Penelope", "year": "2006", "journal-title": "Explorations in Cognitive Diversity"}, {"key": "p_8", "first-page": "244", "volume": "11", "author": "Gehrke Berit", "year": "2007", "journal-title": "Proceedings of Sinn und Bedeutung"}, {"key": "p_23", "doi-asserted-by": "crossref", "first-page": "83", "DOI": "10.1075/tsl.66.06kop", "author": "Kopecka Anette", "year": "2006", "journal-title": "Linguistic Systems and Cognitive Categories"}, {"key": "p_31", "doi-asserted-by": "publisher", "DOI": "10.1515/cogl.1990.1.1.5"}, {"key": "p_45", "first-page": "311", "volume": "18", "author": "Sivonen Jari", "year": "2005", "journal-title": "SKY Journal of Linguistics"}, {"key": "p_50", "doi-asserted-by": "crossref", "first-page": "7", "DOI": "10.1075/prag.1.1.01slo", "volume": "1", "year": "1991", "journal-title": "Pragmatics"}, {"key": "p_53", "first-page": "181", "volume": "4", "author": "Talmy Leonard", "year": "1975", "journal-title": "Syntax and Semantics"}], "container-title": ["Cognitive Linguistics in Action"], "link": [{"URL": "https://www.degruyterbrill.com/document/doi/10.1515/9783110226096.3.241/xml", "content-type": "application/xml", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "text-mining"}, {"URL": "https://www.degruyterbrill.com/document/doi/10.1515/9783110226096.3.241/pdf", "content-type": "unspecified", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "similarity-checking"}], "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2026, 4, 4]], "date-time": "2026-04-04T20:41:56Z", "timestamp": 1775335316000}, "score": 20.056278, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://www.degruyterbrill.com/document/doi/10.1515/9783110226096.3.241/html"}}, "issued": {"date-parts": [[2010, 9, 16]]}, "ISBN": ["9783110205817", "9783110226096"], "references-count": 7, "alternative-id": ["10.1515/9783110226096.3.241", "10.1515/9783110226096"], "URL": "https://doi.org/10.1515/9783110226096.3.241", "published": {"date-parts": [[2010, 9, 16]]}}, {"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2026, 7, 2]], "date-time": "2026-07-02T15:27:36Z", "timestamp": 1783006056528, "version": "3.54.5"}, "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Walter de Gruyter GmbH", "issue": "2", "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "published-print": {"date-parts": [[2012, 5, 25]]}, "abstract": "<jats:title>Abstract</jats:title><jats:p>The acquisition of the past tense has received substantial attention in the psycholinguistics literature, yet most studies report data from English or closely related Indo-European languages. We report on a past tense elicitation study on 136 4–6-year-old children that were acquiring a highly inflected Finno-Ugric (Uralic) language—Finnish. The children were tested on real and novel verbs (N = 120) exhibiting (1) productive, (2) semi-productive, or (3) non-productive inflectional processes manipulated for frequency and phonological neighbourhood density (PND). We found that Finnish children are sensitive to lemma/base frequency and PND when processing inflected words, suggesting that even though children were using suffixation processes, they were also paying attention to the item level properties of the past tense verbs. This paper contributes to the growing body of research suggesting a single analogical/associative mechanism is sufficient in processing both productive (i.e., regular-like) and non-productive (i.e., irregular-like) words. We argue that seemingly rule-like elements in inflectional morphology are an emergent property of the lexicon.</jats:p>", "DOI": "10.1515/cog-2012-0009", "type": "journal-article", "created": {"date-parts": [[2012, 4, 17]], "date-time": "2012-04-17T00:02:01Z", "timestamp": 1334620921000}, "page": "273-315", "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 25, "title": ["The effect of frequency and phonological neighbourhood density on the acquisition of past tense verbs by Finnish children"], "prefix": "10.1515", "volume": "23", "author": [{"given": "Minna", "family": "Kirjavainen,", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [{"name": "1University of Manchester, UK"}], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"given": "Alexandre", "family": "Nikolaev,", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [{"name": "2University of Eastern Finland"}], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"given": "Evan", "family": "Kidd,", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [{"name": "3The Australian National University"}], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}], "member": "374", "container-title": ["Cognitive Linguistics"], "link": [{"URL": "https://www.degruyter.com/view/journals/cogl/23/2/article-p273.xml", "content-type": "text/html", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "text-mining"}, {"URL": "https://www.degruyter.com/downloadpdf/journals/cogl/23/2/article-p273.xml", "content-type": "unspecified", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "similarity-checking"}], "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2021, 2, 28]], "date-time": "2021-02-28T03:06:37Z", "timestamp": 1614481597000}, "score": 18.282417, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://www.degruyter.com/document/doi/10.1515/cog-2012-0009/html"}}, "issued": {"date-parts": [[2012, 5, 25]]}, "references-count": 0, "journal-issue": {"issue": "2"}, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.1515/cog-2012-0009", "ISSN": ["1613-3641", "0936-5907"], "issn-type": [{"value": "1613-3641", "type": "electronic"}, {"value": "0936-5907", "type": "print"}], "published": {"date-parts": [[2012, 5, 25]]}}]], ["Japanese nominative objects", [{"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2025, 11, 4]], "date-time": "2025-11-04T16:02:16Z", "timestamp": 1762272136984}, "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Walter de Gruyter GmbH", "issue": "1", "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "published-print": {"date-parts": [[1992, 1, 1]]}, "DOI": "10.1515/jjl-1992-0105", "type": "journal-article", "created": {"date-parts": [[2017, 7, 4]], "date-time": "2017-07-04T09:31:14Z", "timestamp": 14991606